                                "sense_id": "3dbb4108-9c1f-3517-a457-6b2bcc8a23ce",
                                "text": "In perfect love, devoid of hateful strife, / Allide with bands of mutuall couplement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1567c26-1ac2-4fb9-bc67-36f1a10b7bc6",
                                "sense_id": "3dbb4108-9c1f-3517-a457-6b2bcc8a23ce",
                                "text": "Making a couplement of proud compare, / With sun and moon, with earth and sea's rich gems, / With April's first-born flowers, and all things rare / That heaven's air in this huge rondure hems."
                            }
                        ]
